w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img alt=\"Booking summary screen asking the customer to rate the job\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"400px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"flex min-h-[70vh] flex-col justify-center md:min-h-[80vh]\"><div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] md:hidden\"><img alt=\"Search results for a plumber in the HandyNaija app\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"710\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-1-search.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-1-search.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-1-search.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\"/></div><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[#5B9A2C]\">01</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#5B9A2C] sm:text-3xl\">Search &amp; Pick an Artisan</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-neutral-600\">Find verified local experts for any job from leaky pipes to electrical work and choose the right artisan for you.</p></div><div class=\"flex min-h-[70vh] flex-col justify-center md:min-h-[80vh]\"><div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] md:hidden\"><img alt=\"Booking details screen showing the inspection fee\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"710\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-2-booking.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-2-booking.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-2-booking.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\"/></div><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[#5B9A2C]\">02</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#5B9A2C] sm:text-3xl\">Book &amp; Pay Inspection Fee</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-neutral-600\">Schedule a convenient date and time for the artisan to visit your location. Pay a small, secure inspection fee to lock in your appointment.</p></div><div class=\"flex min-h-[70vh] flex-col justify-center md:min-h-[80vh]\"><div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] md:hidden\"><img alt=\"Artisan and customer shaking hands after agreeing on a quote\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"710\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\"/></div><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[#5B9A2C]\">03</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#5B9A2C] sm:text-3xl\">Get an On-Site Quote</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-neutral-600\">The artisan will assess the task in person and send a detailed, final price directly to your app. No hidden charges, just transparent pricing.</p></div><div class=\"flex min-h-[70vh] flex-col justify-center md:min-h-[80vh]\"><div class=\"mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] md:hidden\"><img alt=\"Booking summary screen asking the customer to rate the job\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"710\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstep-4-review.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\"/></div><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[#5B9A2C]\">04</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#5B9A2C] sm:text-3xl\">Approve &amp; Release Funds</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-neutral-600\">Approve the quote to hold your money safely in our escrow vault. You only release the final payment when the job is completed to your satisfaction.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white px-6 py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border border-green-300 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-neutral-700\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#5B9A2C]\"></span>FOR ARTISANS</span><h2 class=\"mt-6 text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl\">Earn Money with HandyNaija</h2><p class=\"font-montserrat mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 sm:text-lg\">Join thousands of vetted professionals across Nigeria earning steady income. For electricians, plumbers, carpenters, and technicians looking for consistent jobs and guaranteed payments.</p></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-neutral-100\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"relative h-[420px] sm:h-[450px]\"><img alt=\"Booking request notification for an AC maintenance job in the HandyNaija app\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-1-bookings.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 text-lg font-medium text-white/90\">Step 1</span></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 sm:text-2xl\">Receive Bookings</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:text-base\">Customers find your profile and book a session with you. You review the preliminary job details and accept the request to get started.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative h-[560px] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl sm:h-[600px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><img alt=\"Artisan inspecting an air conditioning unit at a customer&#x27;s home\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-2-inspection.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/85 via-black/10 to-transparent\"></div><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 text-lg font-medium text-white/90\">Step 2</span><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-6 sm:p-8\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white sm:text-2xl\">On-Site Inspection</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85 sm:text-base\">Visit the customer&#x27;s location to inspect the job firsthand. This allows you to accurately evaluate the problem, the scope of work, and any materials needed.</p></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-neutral-100\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"relative h-[420px] sm:h-[450px]\"><img alt=\"Decorative wave pattern\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-3-quote.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 text-lg font-medium text-white/90\">Step 3</span></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 sm:text-2xl\">Send Your Quote</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:text-base\">Submit a final, detailed quote directly through the app based on your inspection. Once the customer approves, their money is locked safely in the HandyNaija escrow vault.</p></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-neutral-100\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"relative h-[420px] sm:h-[450px]\"><img alt=\"Earnings dashboard in the HandyNaija app showing weekly income and a withdrawal button\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fartisans%2Fstep-4-earnings.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 text-lg font-medium text-white/90\">Step 4</span></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 sm:text-2xl\">Work &amp; Get Paid</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:text-base\">Execute the task with your usual mastery. Once you are done, the customer confirms the job is complete, and the secured funds are instantly released into your wallet.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"overflow-hidden bg-white py-24\"><div class=\"